# Copy to `.sensitive-patterns` at the repo root (gitignored) and fill in YOUR identifiers.
# One case-insensitive regex per line; `#` starts a comment.
# scripts/check_sensitive.py fails if any of these appear in published files.
#
# Things worth listing:
#   - your Windows / Linux user name(s)
#   - your real name, gamer tags, other handles you don't want linked
#   - machine host names, Tailscale node names
#   - personal e-mail addresses you don't want published
#   - names of private projects/servers that shouldn't be mentioned
#
# Examples (replace these):
# \byourusername\b
# \bFirstname\s+Lastname\b
# \bmy-laptop-hostname\b
# yourname@outlook\.com
